[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0010","text":"那么……开始……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0020","text":"哇——！／哦哦～！／呵呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0030","text":"樱花色……水色……浅绿色……\n春色的……曲奇……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0040","text":"这么可爱的点心\n都不舍得吃了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0050","text":"是的！\n吃了就看不到了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0060","text":"今天就算了吧\n制作人也说了大家一起吃——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0070","text":"那、那个……————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0080","text":"虽然这么想……\n但看起来很好吃，就稍微吃一点吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0090","text":"我想吃！\n其实我也肚子饿了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_02_0100","text":"好……春色……\n稍微吃一点……"}]
